{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>You shall break it into pieces.</b> To include all meal-offerings that are baked before handful-taking for breaking (Menachot 75a)." "<b>And you shall pour oil upon it — it is a meal-offering.</b> To include all meal-offerings for oil-pouring. One might say even an oven-baked meal-offering too — therefore Scripture says ״upon it״; that would exclude the חַלּוֹת but not exclude the רְקִיקִין — therefore Scripture says ״it״ (Menachot 75a)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:04:45.628116032Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}